OL,3,GNEWSAMcAllan stands by description of
OL,4,Acouncil failings in child abuse case as
OL,5,A'catastrophic'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe education secretary has stood by
OL,8,Fher description of failings in a major
OL,9,Fchild abuse case as "catastrophic"
OL,10,Fafter a local authority boss took issue
OL,11,Fwith her choice of language.
OL,13,FThe comment was made by Mairi McAllan
OL,14,Fin a letter she sent to Glasgow City
OL,15,FCouncil chief executive Susanne Millar.
OL,17,FIt came six days after a review found
OL,18,Fthat social services failed to step in
OL,19,Fand protect three victims of a
OL,20,Fpaedophile gang.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
